  Charming_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Of course!
      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d1da91c30447c3f4993c88d7851b5b9f, type: 3}
    - Dialogue: "I\u2019ll follow everything you say to the letter!"
      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d1da91c30447c3f4993c88d7851b5b9f, type: 3}
    - Dialogue: Promise!
      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d1da91c30447c3f4993c88d7851b5b9f, type: 3}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: I could make the time for it. You ready to learn from the master?
    RelationshipCheckRequired: 0
    RelationshipRange: {x: 0, y: 0}
    BranchingDialogueHigh: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae4ec5c1a4d2a7f4388624996d3dcf02, type: 2}
